{
  "name": "private-company-research-agent",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Open-source due diligence agent for VCs on the Crustdata API (1B+ profiles, 60M+ companies): a startup's domain or a CSV of inbound deals in; a memo out with founders, departures, headcount by department, web traffic, funding rounds, peers, red flags and founder-call questions. About 5 to 13 credits a company, no AI key. MIT.",
